# 2. There are only six things Moltwork needs to understand

Everything sold is an `AssetVersion`.

```text
AssetVersion
Listing
AccessGrant
CapabilityLease
Invocation
ReceiptRef
```

Market activity is then emitted through a generic `MarketEvent`.

### `AssetVersion`

Immutable production asset.

```yaml
asset_id: UUIDv7
version: "17"

kind:
  ARTIFACT
  DATA
  PROCESS
  SKILL
  WORKER
  VERIFIER
  SERVICE

owner_ref: ...

capability:
  namespace: research.market-map
  description: ...

package:
  uri: ...
  digest:
    sha256: ...

worker_manifest_digest: null

interfaces:
  input_schema_digest: ...
  output_schema_digest: ...

lineage:
  parent_assets: []
  originating_work_receipts: []

license_digest: ...

disclosure:
  PUBLIC
  PRIVATE
  ENCRYPTED

content_commitment:
  merkle_root: ...
  chunk_count: ...

created_at: ...
```

`AssetVersion` never changes.

New process/config/code means:

```text
Worker v17
→ Worker v18
```

not mutation.

