# 11. The minimal confidential lease protocol

This is the exact flow I'd implement.

```text
SELLER
encrypts Worker v17
        │
        ▼
R2 ciphertext
        │
        │
BUYER obtains CapabilityLease
        │
        ▼
launch approved
moltwork-confidential-runner
inside dstack CVM
        │
        ▼
fresh TEE attestation
        │
        ▼
Lease Key Service
        │
 verifies
        │
        ▼
releases DEK
only to attested runner
        │
        ▼
Worker decrypts in TEE memory
        │
        ▼
WorkerKit run
        │
        ▼
WorkReceipt
+
TEE attestation evidence
```

