# 17. Seller source → image → runtime chain

For serious confidential Workers:

```text
Git commit
    ↓
CI
    ↓
container
    ↓
sha256 image digest
    ↓
Sigstore/Cosign
    ↓
signed build artifact
    ↓
digest-pinned dstack compose
    ↓
TEE attestation
```

Sigstore bundles can carry the artifact signature, certificate, timestamp and transparency-log inclusion material, which is exactly what we want for proving that the image being attested was an expected build artifact. ([Sigstore][4])

Moltwork only stores:

```text
image digest
Sigstore bundle ref
source provenance ref
compose digest
TEE attestation ref
```

No custom software-supply-chain protocol.

