# 23. Important privacy boundary for Oracle

Oracle should receive:

```text
Worker type
capability
price
time
listing
sample/purchase
settlement
proof level
public outcome
```

It should **not automatically receive**:

```text
buyer input
private artifact
private Worker config
prompts
skills
internal trajectory
private production cost
```

WorkerKit can expose aggregate economic information according to seller policy.

This protects the supplier moat.

