# 24. ERC-8004 compatibility should be export-only initially

ERC-8004 already provides portable:

```text
Identity
Reputation feedback
Validation
```

and explicitly allows TEE-based and other validation approaches while keeping payment orthogonal. ([Ethereum Improvement Proposals][6])

Therefore:

```text
Moltwork asset/Worker
→ optionally links ERC-8004 identity

Moltwork WorkReceipt
→ optionally published as validation request/evidence

Moltwork outcome
→ optionally exported as reputation feedback
```

Do **not** make ERC-8004 required.

And do not implement our own agent NFT registry.

