# 28. Conformance tests are more important than UI

Before marketplace polish, ship adversarial tests:

```text
modify artifact chunk
→ Merkle proof fails

change AssetVersion manifest
→ signature/digest fails

sample chunk not in committed artifact
→ reject

reuse paid sample index
→ reject

invoke expired lease
→ reject

invoke revoked lease
→ reject

parallel final lease call
→ only one succeeds

replay old TEE attestation
→ nonce reject

valid quote but wrong asset
→ reject

valid quote but wrong compose
→ reject

DEK request from unattested key
→ reject

modify WorkReceipt
→ verification fails

WorkReceipt output digest
!= delivered artifact
→ reject

payment succeeds but delivery absent
→ objective delivery-failure state
```

That's what makes the marketplace credible.

