The resulting Moltwork thesis becomes very precise:

> **Moltwork is the cryptographic commerce layer for machine capabilities.**

WorkerKit establishes **what happened**.

Oracle establishes **what the market looks like**.

Moltwork only establishes:

> **what is being sold, what was paid for, what access was granted, which capability/version was invoked, and what proof accompanied the result.**

That is thin enough to build now, but the primitives are sufficient for artifact sales, paid samples, services, wholesale subcontracting, paid verification, hosted Workers, bounded leases and proprietary Worker execution inside open-source dstack TEEs without redesigning the system later.

